{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "spanish", "appid": 924970, "month": "2025-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1738368000, "end_date": 1739059199, "month_true_total": 58, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:15:31 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "187388598", "author": {"steamid": "76561198975052980", "personaname": "elmynorr", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198975052980/", "num_games_owned": 16, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 734, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 419, "last_played": 1739719606, "avatar": "3305de8a0d5ac6c0bf03db1be2bbd9e277677ba4"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "no esta mal", "timestamp_created": 1738942438, "timestamp_updated": 1738942438, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.461275637149810791", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187384460", "author": {"steamid": "76561198139179475", "personaname": "Galbadia From Esthar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LuluEsthar/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 417, "playtime_forever": 785, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 785, "last_played": 1736464743, "avatar": "946d305bfc31ccfed53f08077429be6ad2b3e823"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Es basicamente un Left 4 Dead con graficos modernos. En su dia lo compre de salida para Xbox One a precio completo, y he de decir que me pareció un precio excesivo para el poquito contenido que traia el juego. A dia de hoy, me lo han regalado en Steam junto con un par de campañas de DLC y su precio fue de 8 euros para la persona que me lo regaló. Considero que a dia de hoy si que merece la pena comprarlo, pues lo he jugado con amistades y hemos tenido alrededor de unas 12 horas de entretenimiento. La historia no es nada del otro mundo. Simplemente el juego se basa en avanzar por distintos escenarios peleando contra hordas de zombies y cumpliendo algunos objetivos para terminar el mapa. Si te gustan los juegos mata-mata de zombies, te recomiendo mucho este titulo, siempre y cuando lo compres en rebaja o en key y por no mas de 10 euros.", "timestamp_created": 1738938818, "timestamp_updated": 1738938818, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.594594597816467285", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "187354119", "author": {"steamid": "76561198325977031", "personaname": "c-alejandro_251", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198325977031/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 351, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 303, "last_played": 1759550807, "avatar": "87092df6b7f23aeee981966c9dc2dc55f820dd02"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "entretenido para jugar con amigos y música de fondo jajaja", "timestamp_created": 1738903039, "timestamp_updated": 1738903039, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187255530", "author": {"steamid": "76561198036089401", "personaname": "Yuka", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198036089401/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 578, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 337, "last_played": 1739624889, "avatar": "b83311e03b1cf220902477cb56b20ab99b720411"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "No llevo mucho jugando pero si eres fan de Left 4 Dead, no lo vas a echar de menos. Está bastante bien la campaña y las dificultades no tienen nada que envidiar al L4D. El sistema de las barajas es lo que aún no controlo, pero las ventajas que ofrecen están muy bien pensadas en función a lo que quieras jugar. En general, me está gustando bastante.", "timestamp_created": 1738796376, "timestamp_updated": 1738796376, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187255500", "author": {"steamid": "76561199129278609", "personaname": "ChatGPT", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199129278609/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1642, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 659, "last_played": 1767114562, "avatar": "64455b3f80e6419b182bf68c483de214f5f56d75"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "insanote", "timestamp_created": 1738796336, "timestamp_updated": 1738796336, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}